.751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Basic Configuration</h3><a id=\"user-content-basic-configuration\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Basic Configuration\" href=\"#basic-configuration\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Navigate to <strong>Stores → Configuration → Advanced → Admin → Admin Activity</strong></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h4 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">General Settings</h4><a id=\"user-content-general-settings\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: General Settings\" href=\"#general-settings\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Enable Admin Activity Logs</strong>: Enable/disable the extension</li>\n<li><strong>Record Login Activity</strong>: Track login and logout activities</li>\n<li><strong>Record Page Visits</strong>: Monitor admin page navigation</li>\n<li><strong>Clear Admin Activity Logs After</strong>: Set how many days to keep logs (default: 90 days)</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">📖 Usage Guide</h2><a id=\"user-content--usage-guide\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📖 Usage Guide\" href=\"#-usage-guide\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Viewing Activity Logs</h3><a id=\"user-content-viewing-activity-logs\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Viewing Activity Logs\" href=\"#viewing-activity-logs\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Navigate to <strong>System → Admin Activity → Admin Activity Logs</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Click View on any log entry to see detailed info.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Login Activity Monitoring</h3><a id=\"user-content-login-activity-monitoring\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Login Activity Monitoring\" href=\"#login-activity-monitoring\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Go to <strong>System → Admin Activity → Admin Login Logs</strong></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Architecture</h2><a id=\"user-content-architecture\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Architecture\" href=\"#architecture\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The module is built around interface-driven services for clean extensibility:</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Interface</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ActivityConfigInterface</code></td>\n<td>Configuration settings (enabled state, log retention)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FieldTrackerInterface</code></td>\n<td>Tracks field-level changes with before/after values</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ModelResolverInterface</code></td>\n<td>Resolves and loads models for activity logging</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ActivityRepositoryInterface</code></td>\n<td>CRUD operations for activity log entries</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LoginRepositoryInterface</code></td>\n<td>CRUD operations for login log entries</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">All interfaces are marked <code>@api</code> and can be customized via DI preferences.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Extensibility</h2><a id=\"user-content-extensibility\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Extensibility\" href=\"#extensibility\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Customizing Tracked Entities</h3><a id=\"user-content-customizing-tracked-entities\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Customizing Tracked Entities\" href=\"#customizing-tracked-entities\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The module uses <code>adminactivity.xml</code> to define which entities are tracked and which fields are skipped during logging.\nThird-party modules can extend this configuration by creating their own <code>etc/adminactivity.xml</code> file.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Example configuration to add a custom entity:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-xml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;config xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;\n        xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=&quot;urn:magento:module:MageOS_AdminActivityLog:etc/adminactivity.xsd&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;modules&gt;\n        &lt;module name=&quot;customer_group&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;label translate=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Customer Group&lt;/label&gt;\n            &lt;models&gt;\n                &lt;class name=&quot;Magento\\Customer\\Model\\Group&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;/models&gt;\n            &lt;events&gt;\n                &lt;event controller_action=&quot;customer_group_save&quot; action_alias=&quot;save&quot; /&gt;\n                &lt;event controller_action=&quot;customer_group_delete&quot; action_alias=&quot;delete&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;/events&gt;\n            &lt;config&gt;\n                &lt;skip_fields&gt;\n                    &lt;field&gt;customer_group_id&lt;/field&gt;\n                    &lt;field&gt;check_if_is_new&lt;/field&gt;\n                &lt;/skip_fields&gt;\n                &lt;configpath constant=&quot;MODULE_CUSTOMER&quot; /&gt;\n                &lt;editurl url=&quot;{{module}}/{{controller}}/edit/id/{{id}}&quot; /&gt;\n                &lt;itemfield field=&quot;customer_group_code&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;/config&gt;\n        &lt;/module&gt;\n    &lt;/modules&gt;\n&lt;/config&gt;\"><pre>&lt;?<span class=\"pl-ent\">xml</span><span class=\"pl-e\"> version</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>1.0<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>?&gt;\n&lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">config</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">xmlns</span><span class=\"pl-e\">:</span><span class=\"pl-e\">xsi</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"pl-e\">xsi</span><span class=\"pl-e\">:</span><span class=\"pl-e\">noNamespaceSchemaLocation</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>urn:magento:module:MageOS_AdminActivityLog:etc/adminactivity.xsd<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>&gt;\n    &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">modules</span>&gt;\n        &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">module</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">name</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>customer_group<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">label</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">translate</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>true<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>&gt;Customer Group&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">label</span>&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">models</span>&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">class</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">name</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Magento\\Customer\\Model\\Group<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> /&gt;\n            &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">models</span>&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">events</span>&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">event</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">controller_action</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>customer_group_save<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"pl-e\">action_alias</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>save<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> /&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">event</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">controller_action</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>customer_group_delete<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"pl-e\">action_alias</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>delete<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> /&gt;\n            &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">events</span>&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">config</span>&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">skip_fields</span>&gt;\n                    &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">field</span>&gt;customer_group_id&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">field</span>&gt;\n                    &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">field</span>&gt;check_if_is_new&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">field</span>&gt;\n                &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">skip_fields</span>&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">configpath</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">constant</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MODULE_CUSTOMER<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> /&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">editurl</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">url</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>{{module}}/{{controller}}/edit/id/{{id}}<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> /&gt;\n                &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">itemfield</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">field</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>customer_group_code<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> /&gt;\n            &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">config</span>&gt;\n        &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">module</span>&gt;\n    &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">modules</span>&gt;\n&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">config</span>&gt;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Skip Fields</h3><a id=\"user-content-skip-fields\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Skip Fields\" href=\"#skip-fields\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To exclude specific fields from being logged (e.g., timestamps, internal IDs), add them to the <code>skip_fields</code> node for the relevant module in your <code>adminactivity.xml</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Protected Fields</h3><a id=\"user-content-protected-fields\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Protected Fields\" href=\"#protected-fields\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Sensitive fields (passwords, tokens, payment data) are automatically excluded from logging. To add custom protected fields:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-xml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;type name=&quot;MageOS\\AdminActivityLog\\Model\\FieldChecker&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;arguments&gt;\n        &lt;argument name=&quot;protectedFields&quot; xsi:type=&quot;array&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;item name=&quot;my_secret_field&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;my_secret_field&lt;/item&gt;\n        &lt;/argument&gt;\n    &lt;/arguments&gt;\n&lt;/type&gt;\"><pre>&lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">type</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">name</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MageOS\\AdminActivityLog\\Model\\FieldChecker<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>&gt;\n    &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">arguments</span>&gt;\n        &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">argument</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">name</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>protectedFields<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"pl-e\">xsi</span><span class=\"pl-e\">:</span><span class=\"pl-e\">type</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>array<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>&gt;\n            &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">item</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">name</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>my_secret_field<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"pl-e\">xsi</span><span class=\"pl-e\">:</span><span class=\"pl-e\">type</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>string<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>&gt;my_secret_field&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">item</span>&gt;\n        &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">argument</span>&gt;\n    &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">arguments</span>&gt;\n&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">type</span>&gt;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Security</h2><a id=\"user-content-security\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Security\" href=\"#security\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Model Allowlist</strong>: Only explicitly allowed model classes can be loaded during activity logging, preventing arbitrary class instantiation.</li>\n<li><strong>Protected Fields</strong>: Sensitive data (passwords, API keys, tokens, payment info) is never logged, configured via DI.</li>\n<li><strong>ACL Permissions</strong>: Control access to activity logs via permission rules.</li>\n<li><strong>CSRF Protection</strong>: All admin actions are protected with form keys.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Performance Notes</h2><a id=\"user-content-performance-notes\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Performance Notes\" href=\"#performance-notes\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Page Visit Logging</strong>: Disabled by default. Enable only if needed, as it creates a log entry for every admin page view.</li>\n<li><strong>Database Indexes</strong>: The module includes indexes on frequently queried columns for optimal filtering performance.</li>\n<li><strong>Bulk Operations</strong>: Log cleanup and activity logging use bulk database operations to minimize overhead.</li>\n<li><strong>Field Truncation</strong>: Large values are truncated at ~64KB to prevent database bloat.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Contributing</h2><a id=\"user-content-contributing\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Contributing\" href=\"#contributing\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Issues and pull requests welcome on GitHub.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This module is licensed under the <a href=\"https://opensource.org/licenses/OSL-3.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Open Software License 3.0</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Support</h2><a id=\"user-content-support\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Support\" href=\"#support\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For bugs or feature requests, please open an issue in the GitHub repository.</p>\n</article></div>"
}
